      "title": "単一view-modelと既存契約維持",
      "statement": "chart・要約・表を同じ派生view-modelから生成し、会計値を二重計算せず、route・API・認証・保存データの契約を変更しない。",
      "source_refs": ["features/feat-mobile-financial-visualization.md", "specs/mobile-financial-visualization.md", "architecture/arch-mobile-financial-frontend.md"],
